Subject: export: 41: graphics,: bad variable name
Message-ID: <20070415085226.GB15330@xyz>

Hello!
                                                  
I also was having the problem regarding the
~/.JGRprefsrc that was posted here before. The
solution that I found was to change one line of
/usr/local/lib/R/site-library/JGR/cont/run
                                                  
  from:
                                                  
    export R_DEFAULT_PACKAGES=$packages
                                                  
  into:
                                                  
    export R_DEFAULT_PACKAGES="$packages"
                                                  
The double quotes make the difference, because
they allow the variable $packages to have spaces.

Regards,

Jakson

